            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A sliding closet door assembly comprises a first door panel (22a); a door frame assembly comprising at least a first side edge strip arrangement, a second side edge strip arrangement, a top edge strip arrangement, and a bottom edge strip arrangement configured to define a door frame (20) extending in a door frame plane, the door frame (20) being adapted to receive and hold said first door panel (22a); and a rider arrangement configured to ride in a door guide rail, wherein the door frame (20) is configured to receive said first door panel (22a) in a door panel insertion direction (T) transversal to the door frame plane. At least one of the strip arrangements comprises an attachment arrangement configured to attach said first door panel (22a) to the door frame (20).</p>
            </abstract>
